Scope and responsibility
==============================================================================

This repository contains diagnostic tooling only. It does not bypass, defeat or
circumvent any access control, region restriction or anti-abuse mechanism of
any third party. The scripts modify local browser configuration only, and they
create a backup (Local State.bak-region-<timestamp>) before writing.

The maintainers accept no responsibility for the consequences of use. Users are
responsible for complying with applicable law and with the terms of service of
every service they access.
